JPEG XS (ISO/IEC 21122)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software can optionally encode and decode JPEG XS (ISO/IEC 21122), carried
as SMPTE ST 2110-22 / RFC 9134. The feature is off by default and is only built
when the separately obtained MooCUDAJXS codec is present; no JPEG XS codec
source is distributed as part of this repository.

JPEG XS is a standardized codec that may be covered by patents and may be
subject to licensing terms independent of this software's Apache 2.0 license.

